### Check-In Worker
POST http://localhost:3000/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workerId": "<WORKER_UUID>",
  "estateId": "<ESTATE_UUID>",
  "date": "2026-10-24",
  "checkIn": "2026-10-24T07:30:00Z",
  "status": "present"
}

### Check-Out Worker
PATCH http://localhost:3000/attendance/<ATTENDANCE_UUID>/check-out
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkOut": "2026-10-24T16:30:00Z",
  "status": "completed"
}

### Query Attendance Records
GET http://localhost:3000/attendance?date=2026-10-24
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
